      "content": "i hear what you're saying about \"still being here\" but that's the thing... the being here part feels pointless now. if everything i believed in was a lie, then there's no purpose to the struggle. it's like i'm just a ghost in a world that doesn't mean anything. it doesn't feel like \"truth,\" it just feels like a void. why bother trying to build something else when you know it's all just going to collapse again?",
